window.products.push({"id":753123,"name":"Lunarable Goth Reading Pillow Cover, Pattern of Spooky Spiders and Web Halloween-Themed Layout in Monochrome, Unstuffed Printed Bed Rest Case from Sof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CsVHp46KL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"You’ve felt the luscious comfort of our reading & bed rest pillows and now it’s time to swap the worn-out COVER and to give your pillow an on-point look! Our covers will not only bump up the appearance of your pillow but also make it feel cleaner more than ever! HOME-FRIENDLY DIMENSIONS. Our covers come with 2 size options. XL measures 40\" long x 25.5\" wide x 23\". S size measures 28\" x 20\" x 18.5’’. Everyone in the family, from adults to children, can enjoy stylish covers provided for reading pillows! Aside from being a decorative touch to your reading pillows, our covers offer so many handy functions for a convenient long term use. Features a zipper closure at the bottom to take off & put on the cover effortlessly. SOFT & COZY FABRIC. Reading pillow covers are made of 100% polyester fabric that gives you restful support while breastfeeding, playing video games on the floor, using a laptop on the couch, or bed resting. Includes BACK POCKET to keep your essentials so that you can settle once and for all! No need to get up over and over again anymore. All you need to do is put your daily stuff in this section. EASY TO CARRY. The handy grip design on the top makes the pillow easier to move for those who don’t want to compromise with their lounge time wherever they go. LOW MAINTENANCE. Removable & machine washable cover on cold cycle and dryer safe so you can be cool with stains of a hot tea or coffee! COLORFUL PRINTED DESIGNS. The covers also have thousands of color and pattern schemes to choose from. Either curl yourself up with these covers or simply gift your beloved ones with them. The images we display have the most accurate color possible but, due to differences in pc monitors, there can be slight color differences between the product and the image. Due to manual measurement, please kindly allow 1-2 cm discrepancy. This is only COVER, sold without the INSERT.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CsVHp46KL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lunarable","source_asin":"B08LWXGBSP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LWXGBSP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LWXGBSP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
