window.products.push({"id":753139,"name":"Hello Spring Pillow Covers 20x20 Set of 4 Floral Throw Pillow Covers Spring Summer Decorative Cushion Covers Truck Biycle Flower Pillow Cases for Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810j6YuaUNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Linen ★ PACKAGE INCLUDED★ :Set of 4 Spring Pillow Covers, No Insert or Filler. Pattern is only on the front and no printing on the back! The Spring Summer pillow cover can help you change Spring home decorations quickly and refresh your room.The Spring pillow cases are printed with Spring flower biycle truck elements,which are perfect decorations for Spring party and seasonal holiday decorations. ★ PILLOW COVERS SIZE★ ：The Spring pillow covers 20x20 set of 4 are 20x20 inches (50 x 50 cm); Please allow a slight deviation with regards to the size of the case due to hand cutting and sewing.The durable Spring outdoor throw pillows will bring a warm and mordern look to your home Spring decor.The Spring Summer pillow cover set is very suitable for couch, bed, sofa, chair, car, etc. ★ MATERIAL★ ：The set of 4 Spring pillow covers are made of durable cotton linen. Extra thick linen, thicker and stronger than ordinary linen,soft and skin-friendly, no fading or abrasion.These linen Spring pillow cases perfectly math with all styles of furniture, such as bed,couch,sofa,or chair.Hello Spring outdoor throw pillows are the perfect addition to your Spring home decor. ★ PERTECT SPRING DECORATIONS FOR HOME★ ：The spring theme pillow covers are designed with flower truck biycle elements,which are perfect for spring summer decorations.The spring pillow covers can help you change spring home decorations quickly and the spring throw pillow covers will refresh your room.The Hello Spring pillow cases are also a perfect seasonal gift for family kids and friends! ★ FASHION DESIGN★ ：Invisible zipper design makes the Spring outdoor decorative pillows more fashionable and beautiful.and the spring pillow case is super easy to stuff pillows/fillers into the seasonal pillow cover. Classic Spring flower truck biycle patterns are printed on these Spring pillow covers will create a warm spring atmosphere for your living room, bedroom, office, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810j6YuaUNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neatee Living","source_asin":"B09Q895W5X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q895W5X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q895W5X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
