window.products.push({"id":753158,"name":"Shower Shelf for Inside Shower - 2 Pack Shower Caddy, Bestdon Adhesive Bathroom Organizer with 4 Hook, No Drilling Wall Mounted Shower Storage, Kitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ldjyh+07S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% SUS304 Stainless Steel 【Large Capacity Shower Caddies】The 2-pack shower shelf for inside shower are spacious enough for a family to store shampoos, conditioners, facial cleansers and other shower accessories. It comes with 4 movable hooks for easy hanging of loofah, razor and bath sponge. Great bathroom shower shelves for saving space in RV, apartment and other small shower, tub areas. 【Sturdy & Durable Shower Shelves】 Waterproof shower caddy adhesive, high viscosity and strong bearing capacity could withstand up to 40 lbs. The shower racks are strong enough that you can placed the heavy bottles with pumps without fear the basket will fall or move. NOTICED: The powerful shower wall caddy should be suctioned to smooth wall surface.Please don't stick to rough wall surface, and wait for 24 hours to use after installation. 【Rustproof & Sleek Design Shower Organization】 Made of 100% SUS304 stainless steel, durable, rustproof and scratch-resistant. Polished and shiny, no sharp edges and don't hurt your hand. Hollow out bottom, without logged water dry quick, keep your item clean. 【Drill-free & Removable Shower Rack】No drilling, no screw or nail and don't damage wall, easy to install. Simply choose a smooth surface, clean and dry the wall, tear off the protective film and stick on, press firmly and ensure no bubbles inside, and the shower storage will stay suctioned to the wall. It also is easy to remove: Use a hairdryer to heat the adhesive, tear it off easily when heat enough. 【What You Get】2 x adhesive bathroom shelf, Size: Large shower shelf: 9.4\"*3.9\"*3.1\"(L*W*H) .Small shower basket: 9.1\"*3.5\"*2.8\"(L*W*H). 4 x movable hooks, 2 x shower shelves adhesive, 1 x manual. If you have any questions about our shower wall shelf, please feel free to contact us. We would provide excellent after-sales service for you to ensure your satisfaction within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ldjyh+07S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bestdon","source_asin":"B09DYN96BY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYN96BY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DYN96BY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":753159,"name":"Leggett & Platt Trenton Swivel Seat Bar Stool with Nutmeg Finished Wood Frame, Ember Seatback Accents and Brown Faux Leather Upholstery, 30-Inch Seat ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gH33-q+sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Trenton has a quiet elegance that will highlight any room, while keep you comfortable when you dine or entertain. A comfortable and portable stool has always had a place in the home (or apartment) for kids doing homework at the counter, paired with bistro tables for casual eating, or used as extra seating in entertaining areas. With this in mind, the Trenton has been designed to provide a relaxing and inviting seat option for many years to come. Constructed of solid wood for strength and stability, this stool is paired with a hand-applied 7-step Nutmeg wood finish, Ember metal accents and a Brown faux leather upholstered seat and back to create a charming appeal. The soft curved design of the back helps set this piece apart, adding an interesting accent. Trenton’s 16.5-inch diameter swivel-seat has a rotating range of 180° to make getting on and off easier and provide effortless turning to focus in other areas when needed. A footrest is provided to rest your heels and plays a very critical role in the comfort experienced by most adults. This unit includes all stool pieces, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Trenton Stool comes with a 1-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gH33-q+sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B00ORW3HG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ORW3HG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ORW3HG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
