window.products.push({"id":753169,"name":"Game of Thrones Stark and Lannister Map Marker Salt and Pepper Shakers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y5lgwhCkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Sometimes meals require strategic planning, especially if you're expected to extend guest right as a host. Let these Game of Thrones Map Marker Salt and Pepper Shakers take care of the salt half while you focus on the bread. Now all you need is a map of Westeros tablecloth. Shaped like the map markers in the show, House Lannister and House Stark can have a showdown on your dinner table. The big choice is going to be which spice goes in which shaker. Do you put salt in Stark because it looks like snow? Do you put pepper in Lannister because House Spicer of Castamere's coat of arms features pepperpots? Only a well-seasoned *cough* general who knows what is at stake should be trusted with these sorts of decisions. Or go wild like GRRM would and put something entirely unexpected in them. Garlic salt. Paprika. Cinnamon and sugar. Because you never know what's just around the corner in GoT. Ha-HA! Cilantro! Aww.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y5lgwhCkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HBO Shop","source_asin":"B00QTTDB2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QTTDB2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QTTDB2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
