window.products.push({"id":753343,"name":"Mason Jar Liquid Soap Dispenser Lids - 304 Stainless Steel Pumps & Lids for 16oz Regular Mouth Mason Jar-Rustic/Farmhouse Decor, for Hand Soap,Dish So","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614SEh43SiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About the pumps: 1.Each Mason Jar Pump designed with 2CC pump core and long Tube. The straw touches the bottom so you'll use most the soap and not waste anything. 2.The Soap Dispenser pump is made of heavy, durable metal(Pump and lid are food safe 100% 304 stainless steel) with a stainless steel spring mechanism,which can be pressed more than 10,000 times in pressing test for years of quality performance. 3.Each pump has large enough nozzle to give the perfect amount of soap,you don't have to pump it multiple times to get enough soap to wash your hands. 4.The pump does not get stuck or clumpy with product, and they don't clog easily. 5.The top plunger is wider and it would be easier to depress it. Pushing the head can achieve good results. 6.Our lotion pumps contain leak-proof gaskets to prevent hand soap and dish soap or other liquid leaking and dripping when not in use, can avoid unwanted waste and keep the countertop clean and tidy. 7.These dispensers are very pretty and minimalist styled. You will love these pumps.The appearance is very beautiful, the operation is simple, the utility is very practical, the price is economical.The pump is able to handle thick liquids as long as the liquid is \"pourable\". You will find our pump bottles to be the perfect solution for dispensing homemade lotions, potions, paints and glues too. No matter where they are placed, they have the grade and beauty,looks classy and professional. Stable product quality, small capacity deviation, high cleanliness and homogeneity.It works perfectly, no leak,pumped so smoothly, not splashing liquid out like some cheap soap pumps do. Package: 6 X Soap / Lotion Dispenser Pump Head 12 X Waterproof Chalkboard Labels Stickers Please note: The qtip holder and toothbrush holder are not included, if you are interested,pleases find the ASIN: B07R3R5RMB","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614SEh43SiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amolliar","source_asin":"B07XMNN17X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XMNN17X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XMNN17X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
