window.products.push({"id":753347,"name":"Barsetto 2 in 1 Upright Stick and Handheld Powerful Suction Vacuum Cleaner with Cordless Design and HEPA Filter, Lightweight and Rechargeable Wall Mou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PHSoxJKzL._AC_SL1445_.jpg","description":"✔【POWERFUL SUCTION】: This vacuum has a strong suction which the absorption rate can reach more than 95%, satisfy every cleaning demands and complete a thorough cleaning mission. Two suction mode can be adjusted according to the actual environment. Suitable for deeply embedded dirt, such as pet hair, deep debris and microscopic dust hidden in the edges and corners. The vacuum cleaner works very quietly, lower than 78db, so will not affect the normal life of your family. ✔【CORDLESS, WALL MOUNT, EASY CHARGE】: Humanized cordless design help you get rid of hassle of cord. With a wall mount base, put the vacuum cleaner on the wall mount base for charging the machine and easy storage. The vacuum cleaner can work continuously for up to 40 minutes after being fully charged. When the power is insufficient, there will be a flashing light to remind you. It can be hung on the wall mount base when charging or just charge directly to the battery. ✔【HEPA FILTRATION SYSTEM】:The efficiency HEPA filtration system can filter dust as small as 0.3 microns. Effortlessly pick up dusts, stubborn pet hair and even deep debris, highly improves the cleaning efficiency. In addition, clean air can be release during use without secondary pollution. There is a small brush head on the roller which is made of ABS material, garbage and hair are not easy to remain on the brush head, very convenient to clean. ✔【FLEXIBLE USING】: The floor brush head can be flexible rotation, multi - directional cleaning. At the same time, the brush head of the vacuum cleaner is equipped with LED headlights, so there is no need to worry about not being able to clean dark corners. The brush head can be combined according to your own needs. and you can also choose upright or handhold by adding or removing the extension attachments adapt to different cleaning situations. It performs well on all kinds of situation. ✔【WARRANTY & SERVICE】: Consumers will get THREE-YEAR warranty of this Vacuum Cleaner. Besides, if you have any problem of this product, Please feel free to contact with our consumer service email, we will give you the best solution as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PHSoxJKzL._AC_SL1445_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barsetto","source_asin":"B07YBWVV46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YBWVV46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YBWVV46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
