window.products.push({"id":753655,"name":"Dwelling With Pride Acrylic Picture Frame Set of 5 - Acrylic Photo Frame - Collage Stand for Family Photographs - Clear Picture Frames for Office Desk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+U6Q5Lj+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of buying picture frames that easily break or shatter? You have been accustomed to using the old, traditional glass frames for so many years. Perhaps they have been handed down to you, or you just simply bought them from a store. Glass, however, is highly breakable. If you have very energetic and playful children at home, you wouldn’t want them running around glass frames. Let shattered glass be a thing of the past with Dwelling With Pride’s Acrylic Picture Frame! Who said you need an actual frame to display your precious memory photos? We at Dwelling With Pride have revolutionized the concept by creating unique premium quality acrylic frames that make your images come to life! Your life’s biggest achievements deserve to be always remembered, so that you appreciate how far you’ve come. For that reason, we’ve incorporated a UV filter on our frames that blocks up to 98% of ultraviolet radiation, preventing your picture from fading and protecting it with time. Our modern and classy frames are shatter resistant, so you can be sure that your kids are safe around them. They are light and compact, which makes them perfect for travel. That’s not all! Our superior frames also come with strong magnets that do not stick or damage photos. Changing pictures is made easy, too! Just manually take the magnets apart, insert your picture, and put them back together. Still not convinced? Here are more reasons to love Dwelling With Pride’s Acrylic Picture Frame: Easy to clean. Just use a smooth microfiber towel or a non-alcohol-based cleaner. Double sides displaying Matte finish that reduces reflection and glare Ideal gift for any occasion Allows you to customize. Turn your memories into an artful photo display! Add Dwelling With Pride Acrylic Picture Frame to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+U6Q5Lj+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dwelling With Pride","source_asin":"B0842XXKLY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842XXKLY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842XXKLY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":753656,"name":"Modus Furniture Atria Bed, California King, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416jeywkimL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Atria California King Size Panel Bed is constructed from 100-percent sheesham solid wood with an acacia slat system. Features sophisticated contemporary design. Natural Sheesham finish showcases the wood’s natural variations in knots, grain, texture and color. Bed comes with 24 solid wood slats and 1 center support for use with or without a box spring. Metal to metal bed rail fittings for easy assembly and long term durability. Clean lines and grooved headboard panel give the piece a contemporary, architectural look. The piece is crafted from full-length planks of solid lumber. There are no finger joints or engineered wood. This product is artisan crafted with meticulous care. Given its handmade and hand-finished nature, variations in the wood or metal work are to be expected and celebrated. By their nature, solid wood planks may be somewhat uneven and may cup or bow slightly over time, further enhancing their rustic one of a kind character. Every piece of the Atria collection is one of a kind with a different and distinctively beautiful plain sawn grain pattern that radiates a refreshing contrast between heartwood and sapwood.  Also known as Indian rosewood, Sheesham is an extremely dense hardwood, sourced from sustainable, government managed plantations.  The platform bed is outfitted with a large, framed headboard panel and a wide platform base to match the natural weight of the lumber. Subtle differences in the rosy wood grain will pick up matching white and brown tones throughout your bedroom. Crafted entirely from solid lumber, the Atria bedroom uses an all-Sheesham exterior with Acacia drawer boxes and mattress support system.  Drawers are mounted on full extension, ball bearing glides for smooth, efficient operation.  With its premium materials, timeless design and quality craftsmanship, the Atria bedroom is a product that will last for generations. Packages include 1 Atria California King Size Panel Bed. Assembly required. Ships in 3 separate boxes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416jeywkimL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modus Furniture","source_asin":"B005ER6B0C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005ER6B0C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005ER6B0C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
