window.products.push({"id":753771,"name":"Lord Will Watch Coming Going Pink 10 x 4 Solid Pine Wood Decorative String Sign","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715MjTTLVWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In 1972, newlyweds Peter and LeAnna Dunn accepted a mission to open a home for runaway girls in New York City. In order to keep the girls occupied, they initiated a small woodworking business. The girls carved plaques and gifts that quickly became popular items at the Greenwich Village outdoor markets. When the mission in New York was complete, the couple bought the woodworking equipment and installed it on their farm in Dalton, Ohio. P. Graham Dunn is a family owned and operated business that opened its doors in 1976. In the early days, the work was labor-intensive. LeAnna and Peter were busy raising 4 energetic children and were running the business out of a revamped chicken coup. For twenty years, Peter designed every plaque, gift and each item of furniture while LeAnna managed the company’s finances. In time, the company began to computerize carving and laser operations and found it could successfully compete with offshore manufacturers. Today P. Graham Dunn serves over 4,000 accounts, most in the U.S., and the remainder in Canada and around the world. Lord Will Watch Coming Going Decorative String Sign features sentiment \"The Lord will watch over your coming and going. Psalm 121:8\" with floral artwork; Looped string is attached to the back, creating signage that can be easily hung vertically from knobs, door handles, and hooks throughout the home. Sign is made of solid pine wood with pink finish; Uplifting sentiment and saying is paired with a weathered, farmhouse-inspired design. Decorative sign measures approximately 10 x 3.5 x 0.34 inches. Perfect for hanging display on a wall in any room of your home. Proudly made in the USA, in the heart of Amish country; Ships in protective packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715MjTTLVWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P. Graham Dunn","source_asin":"B07VSRFB6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VSRFB6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VSRFB6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
