window.products.push({"id":753793,"name":"Wusthof Limited Edition 200th Anniversary 2pc Knife Set-Carbon Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":495.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wSTIQa-qL._AC_SL1460_.jpg","description":"The Wusthof classic 2 Piece Anniversary Set features a 9“ cook's knife and a 3.5“ paring knife. This incredible set is made from precision forged high-carbon steel using traditional methods and a 50 plus step process. Each knife has Wusthof's signature bolster/finger guard at the base of the blade to give the knives heft and a solid, balanced feel. The 200th anniversary set is distinguished by dark purplish-brown rosewood handles with triple brass rivets. The set comes in a gift box with care instructions, additional information and special oil for maintaining the blades. Made in Germany. Hand-washing recommended.Forged from one piece of carbon steel to ensure outstanding strength and edge retentionGift packagedExtraordinary sharpness which is easy to maintainSpecial alloyed steel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wSTIQa-qL._AC_SL1460_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B00ICSX5UO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ICSX5UO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ICSX5UO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
