window.products.push({"id":753939,"name":"Topboro, Multifunctional Smash Machine Grinder for Spices and Seeds, Portable Electric Household Food Suitable Coffee Beans Grains Seasonings Spices,B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IGA5c1OxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you still worrying about not having coffee for breakfast? Are you worried about taking time out to buy coffee? Our coffee grinder can save time so you can easily enjoy a cup of delicious coffee every day. When you are tired, you can manually grind a cup of coffee to help you refresh yourself. Specification: Material: Stainless steel Power: 150W Voltage: 110V-220V Frequency: 50Hz Color: Blue Switch control: Button Packing size: 17* 10.5 * 5cm The package includes: 1 *Multi-function Smash Machiner Feature: 1. The multifunctional grinder occupies a small space and is easy to store. 2. Easy to use, just press and hold the switch button to start grinding coffee beans or other spices, which is very convenient. 3. The grinder is easy to clean, and will not leave a peculiar smell, crushing different beans will never produce color and smell. 4. With a sharp stainless steel blade, it can quickly grind coffee beans into a fine powder and is not easy to rust, providing a more uniform grinding effect. 5. The transparent lid is easy to observe and can accurately grind the required ingredients. 6. The portable grinder has a low-noise function, which reduces unnecessary noise during the grinding process, and allows you and your family to have a quieter atmosphere in the morning. Steps for usage: 1: Put the coffee beans or spices into the grinder. 2: Close the transparent cover tightly. 3: Press the on/off button and wait for 30 seconds. 4: Observe the thickness of the powder according to personal preference, remove the lid and pour out the powder. Note: This product is suitable for use over 7 years old. Do not let children reach into the grinder to avoid scratches by the blade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IGA5c1OxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topboro","source_asin":"B09K5JYWYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K5JYWYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K5JYWYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
