window.products.push({"id":753955,"name":"Mesh Bra Bags for Laundry(9 Pack) by MDSXO, White Lingerie Bags for Washing Delicates,baby laundry,sock,Travel Storage[1XXL/2XL/3L/2M/2bra bags]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pAly09EuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Package included】 You will get 10 Pack MDSXO laundry delicates bags (1Pack XXL: 24*24 inch, 2Pack XL：23.6*19.7inch, 2Pack L: 19.7*15.7inch, 2 Pack M: 15.7*11.8inch, 2 Pack Bra bags: 5.9*6.7inch) Different sizes of laundry nets are suitable for different sizes of clothing. Make your clean life easier! 【New upgrade mesh design】 The mesh washing bag is made of durable polyester. The regular mesh makes the flow of water and washing smoother and can be cleaned by rubbing against clothes. It can protect your clothes well without affecting the washing of the clothes. 【Fine and delicate seams】The wash bag is made of 100% highly breathable polyester fiber, which is hygienic, safe, clean and no awful smell. The lingerie bags with tight edging process and reinforced internal interface edging make our laundry bags very durable. 【Zipper protection design】There is a protective cover on the zipper when in use, so there is no need to worry about damaging the clothes. 【Warm tips】 About 70% of the delicates laundry bag should be filled with clothes. Do not load the washing machine too full, it has a better decontamination ability when it is filled with 70% clothes. Please do not pull the zipper on the mesh laundry bags to the end to prevent the zipper from falling off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pAly09EuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MDSXO","source_asin":"B0BNNF2TT4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNNF2TT4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNNF2TT4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
