window.products.push({"id":753958,"name":"The Geeky Days Cowboy Roping a Steer Coat Rack Hook Household Decor American Style Towel Bags Clothes Hook Keys Holder Bathroom Living Room Decor Hang","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fNyT-YFcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Fix this on the wall of your entryway and it is sure to grab the attention of guests entering who will be full of smiles and praises. A wall hook with a eye-catching sign is something just perfect for the hallway. This one here is made from good quality black wood 3mm thick and will last in prim condition for a long time. It features five hooks made of metal. Use these hooks to hang keys, coats, sling bags or cloth bags. So well carved, it is sure to make the walls it is mounted on captivating. Light in weight, this wall hook is easy to fix. You can also fix it in your living room, bedroom or bath area. It's a fine accent to lake, lodge and outdoorsy decor, and is great as a housewarming gift! So, order this for your home soon. Measures 11.8\" wide . 5 mounting holes drilled for mounting. 5 Hooks included but mounting hardware tools not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fNyT-YFcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Geeky Days","source_asin":"B07CH7F879","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CH7F879","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CH7F879","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":753959,"name":"Bee's Wrap - Assorted 3 Pack - Made in the USA with Certified Organic Cotton - Plastic and Silicone Free - Reusable Beeswax Food Wraps in 3 Sizes (S,M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XQ+wIYpkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Fresh Take on Food Storage: Meet Bee’s Wrap - uniquely designed reusable beeswax food wraps that eliminate single-use plastic and keep food fresh. From prepping meals and storing leftovers in the kitchen to packing lunches and snacks on the go, Bee’s Wrap has you covered. It makes an easy, yet thoughtful gift for holidays, housewarmings, dinner parties and potlucks. Plastic-Free and Silicone-Free: Because good food deserves good care. A Size for Every Occasion: Use your small wrap (7x8) to store half a lemon or avocado, the end of a cucumber, a handful of cherries. Medium (10x11) is great for cheese, baked goods, half a cabbage or grapefruit, covering a Mason jar or small bowl and packing snacks. Large (13x14) is ideal for covering a bowl or pie dish and wrapping big bunches of produce like leafy greens, asparagus and carrots. Made in the USA: with certified organic cotton, responsibly-sourced beeswax, certified organic plant oils, and tree resin. This combination creates a durable, yet pliable plastic wrap alternative that can be used again and again and again. Wrap Care 101: Use the warmth of your hand to create a seal around food, bowls and pans. Bee’s Wrap will hold its shape when it cools, creating a breathable seal. Rinse your beeswax wrap in cool water with mild soap, then air dry. Reuse your Bee’s Wrap for up to a year with regular use and proper care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XQ+wIYpkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bee's Wrap","source_asin":"B0958RKT64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0958RKT64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0958RKT64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
