window.products.push({"id":753964,"name":"Chef's Design 18-Quart Covered Oval Roaster with Nonstick Interior","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+ZcHhz19S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Cook the roast slowly in the oven just like Grandma used to with the 18-qt. Covered Aluminum Nonstick Roaster with Rack. Ideal for braising, stewing, steaming and poaching too, the heavy cast aluminum set conducts heat evenly without hot spots, and won’t warp over time. After roasting the meat, there’s no need to use a separate pan to thicken the sauce: simply transfer the pan from the oven to the stovetop. You don’t have to use a different serving dish, either—the pan, with its polished exterior, looks marvelous at the table. Features a nonstick interior, self-basting lid, anodized aluminum meat rack and heavy-gauge nonstick roaster basket. Imported. 11-1/2Hx13Wx21L\". Amazon.com This 18-inch-long, oval roaster is extremely versatile and can cook up a wide selection of giant roasts and meals for holiday entertaining or other large parties. As with cookware from earlier eras, this roaster is constructed of heavy and sturdy cast aluminum, which is a marvelous conductor of heat for fast and even cooking. The exterior is brushed and has an elegant silvery finish that makes it spectacular for serving as well as cooking. The interior is coated with Eclipse, a premium, long-lasting nonstick surface that makes the usual baked-on fat and grease from roasting meats much easier to clean. With the cover off, this heirloom-quality pan roasts a huge turkey or roast beef. However, the roaster also has deep, 6-inch sides and a dome-shaped cover (also with an interior coating of nonstick), making it ideal for braising meat dishes, such as short ribs with noodles, steaming numerous fish fillets, or poaching a whole salmon. The domed cover plays a large role in the success of these moist-heat cooking methods as it keeps moisture from escaping and encourages self-basting of meats. Additionally, the roaster is completely safe for using on the range top on low to medium heat so meats can be browned and roasted in one pan. Two amply sized 1-1/2-inch tab handles on either side of the roaster are oven-safe and ensure a secure hold on this substantially weighted piece when lifting it out of the oven or bringing it to the table. The riveted stainless-steel handle on the top of the lid conveniently stays cool under high heats. This roaster comes with an anodized aluminum meat rack (which is really more like a trivet) that lifts roasts just a tad above the bottom of the cookware. To enjoy extended use with this roaster, the manufacturer recommends washing it by hand in warm soapy water and discourages the use of metal utensils, knives, or abrasive sponges that could damage the nonstick coating. The limited warranty on this product is offered by Wisconsin Aluminum Foundry for a period of 50 years. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+ZcHhz19S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef's Design","source_asin":"B0002808SY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-753964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002808SY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002808SY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
